 and has led to a decline in revenue and occupancy rates for traditional hotels in certain markets.\n                    ",[6761,7208],"\n                      Airbnb has also had a significant impact on the hospitality industry, particularly in the area of hotels and other traditional accommodation providers, which are often referred to as the HORECA industry. Some industry experts believe that Airbnb&#39;s rapid growth has disrupted the traditional HORECA model, and has led to a decline in revenue and occupancy rates for traditional hotels in certain markets.\n                    ",[6761,7208],"\n                      Airbnb has also had a significant impact on the hospitality industry, particularly in the area of hotels and other traditional accommodation providers, which are often referred to as the HORECA industry. Some industry experts believe that Airbnb&rsquo;s rapid growth has disrupted the traditional HORECA model, and has led to a decline in revenue and occupancy rates for traditional hotels in certain markets.\n                    ","HeroInsighter",[141,197],"Clients",[261,304],"FloatingPublishButton",[504,577],[1369,1372],"unknown",[1369,1372],"never",[6080,6095],"[token, locale, setUserTimezone, fetchProfileWithRetry, handleRedirect]",[9506,9509],[9506,9509],[12528,12531],[12528,12531],"Locale",[0,41],[1379,1382],[1379,1382],[6346,6372],"[token, locale, returnUrl, setUserTimezone, fetchProfileWithRetry, handleRedirect]",[10195,10198],[10195,10198],[16709,16712],[16709,16712],"Divider",[204,215],[9873,9887],"[slug, locale, toast, translations.orderError]",[22317,22343],"[showSuccessUI, orderUuid, waitForKnowledgeDownloadId, triggerAccountDownload]",[48773,48776],[48773,48776],[52672,52675],[52672,52675],[54914,54917],[54914,54917],[60813,60816],[60813,60816],"ActionIcon",[147,158],"IconLayoutSidebarLeftCollapse",[286,316],"IconLayoutSidebarLeftExpand",[277,375],[156,167],"IconChevronLeft",[329,348],"IconAdjustmentsHorizontal",[348,377],[1331,1334],[1331